Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:05.62,main,Drone,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.62,0:00:07.59,main,Drone,0,0,0,,All forces, charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.59,0:00:09.36,main,Combatants,0,0,0,,Kii!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.36,0:00:10.28,main,Blue,0,0,0,,They're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.28,0:00:11.86,main,Blue,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:14.67,main,Blue,0,0,0,,Wh-What the—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.67,0:00:16.55,main,Blue,0,0,0,,My Swordgun broke?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.55,0:00:17.95,main,Pink,0,0,0,,Mine did, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.70,0:00:20.75,main,Blue,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.53,0:00:25.67,main,Judgment,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.05,0:02:00.51,sign_8302_60_Episode_1__I_Lov,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(836,1)\an1\pos(200,305)\fsp.5}Episode 11   {\fsp1}What's the Point of Getting Closer?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.11,0:02:10.26,main,Beast,0,0,0,,What's with you, Reaper?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.26,0:02:11.58,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Oh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:14.93,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I was just thinking, she's always by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.86,0:02:22.70,sign_18317_218_Gekko_Princess_S,sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(110,255)\fad(1026,1)}Gekko Princess Series\NJudgment Princess\N{\fs21}Ranran
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.27,0:02:17.54,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Judgment, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.54,0:02:20.64,main,Beast,0,0,0,,She's a perpetual loner who \Nperforms her missions in silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.64,0:02:22.70,main,Beast,0,0,0,,The ideal Gekko soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.70,0:02:26.12,main,Steel,0,0,0,,Although when she removes her mask, \Nshe has quite a charming appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.12,0:02:27.21,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.21,0:02:28.63,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go talk to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.63,0:02:31.08,main,Beast,0,0,0,,C'mon, mind your own business already!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.82,0:02:35.30,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Hey, Judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.01,0:02:38.01,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Want to eat with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.91,0:02:45.15,main,Judgment,0,0,0,,Another time, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.41,0:02:54.77,main,Drone,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, Reaper-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.17,0:02:57.09,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Drone Rabbit-senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.09,0:03:00.53,main,Drone,0,0,0,,You know she's part of \Nmy sixth squadron, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.53,0:03:05.66,sign_4329_29_Dish_Return_Leav,sign,0,0,0,,Dish Return\N{\fs11\c&HAA9B8E&\3c&HFEFFFF&\bord2}Leave no scraps behind! -—Bosslar
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.87,0:03:03.91,main,Drone,0,0,0,,Our team specializes in covert \Noperations and espionage,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.91,0:03:08.87,main,Drone,0,0,0,,so she's been trained specially \Nin that since she joined Gekko.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.87,0:03:10.92,main,Drone,0,0,0,,Avoiding interpersonal \Nrelationships and such.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.43,0:03:16.34,main,Drone,0,0,0,,I've asked her to at least open \Nup to her comrades, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.68,0:03:18.53,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.84,0:03:21.87,main,Combatant A,0,0,0,,You sounded great again today!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.87,0:03:22.84,main,Combatant B,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.28,0:03:25.57,main,Combatant A,0,0,0,,Greetings!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.57,0:03:26.85,main,Combatant B,0,0,0,,Judgment Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.72,0:03:39.32,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Hold it, Judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.67,0:03:40.50,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.35,0:03:47.30,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,And you'd better be there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:55.04,sign_5575_11_Princess_Series_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(285,45)\frz2.867}Princess Series Strategy Meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:55.04,sign_5575_11_Princess_Series_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz2.867\pos(278,195)\c&H221A34&\fs16\fsp5}Tonight at 6
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:55.04,sign_5575_11_Princess_Series_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H221A34&\fs16\fsp6\pos(290,240)\frz3.722}Gekko Women's Dorm
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:55.04,sign_5575_11_Princess_Series_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H221A34&\fs16\fsp6\frz3.722\pos(305,275)}Reaper Princess's Room
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:55.04,sign_5575_11_Princess_Series_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H221A34&\fs16\fsp6\frz3.722\pos(307,320)}Bring Pajamas
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.51,0:03:54.33,main,Judgment,0,0,0,,Strategy meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.46,0:04:01.30,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Hey, Reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.30,0:04:06.05,sign_5786_49_Princess_Series_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(310,165,310,0)\fs18\fsp1}Princess Series\N{\fsp0\fs22}Pajama Takoyaki Sleepover
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.52,0:04:03.20,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,You tricked us, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.20,0:04:04.34,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.34,0:04:05.89,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,When I heard you were holding \Na strategy meeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.89,0:04:08.50,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,I thought it meant you were \Nfinally taking things seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.50,0:04:12.47,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,And yet, you still attended in pajamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.08,0:04:14.52,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.91,0:04:15.94,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.67,0:04:19.81,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,When did you two get so chummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.81,0:04:22.65,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I wish I could tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.26,0:04:30.98,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Knowing you, you set this up to get \Ncloser to Judgment Princess, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.98,0:04:33.29,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,But there's no way she's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.52,0:04:36.97,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Unlike you, she's a solitary warrior who—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.96,0:04:40.09,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,It's open! Come on in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.57,0:04:52.39,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo... why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.39,0:04:54.06,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,H-Hey, you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.06,0:04:55.53,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,Red Gelato?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.53,0:04:58.73,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Going for a one-man raid, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.94,0:05:02.11,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.11,0:05:03.45,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Can it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:04.97,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Can it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.70,0:05:08.28,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Fine by me! I'll take it from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.52,0:05:10.78,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Wait, Beast! That's—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.67,0:05:16.97,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.97,0:05:18.54,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,It is I. Surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.06,0:05:22.50,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,Though I admit, your perpetual \Ncombat readiness does impress.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.98,0:05:26.38,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,Did you see through my disguise, Reaper?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.66,0:05:30.50,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,First, {\i1}he{\i0} would never take his shoes \Noff in such a haphazard fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.50,0:05:33.64,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,And your biceps brachii \Nmuscles were a bit too small.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.64,0:05:34.76,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.76,0:05:38.41,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,That's the rival I know. \NShe really does her research.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.36,0:05:50.79,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Okay, it's ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.24,0:05:52.62,main,Both,0,0,0,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.70,0:05:57.58,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Hey, that's pretty tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.58,0:05:59.29,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,It's wonderful with cheese in, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.80,0:06:06.20,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,I was informed that this \Nwas a strategy meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:07.75,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,What is its actual point?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.75,0:06:10.28,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,It's more like a friendly gathering.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.28,0:06:13.93,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,The purpose is for all of us to get closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.18,0:06:17.16,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,What is the point of getting closer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.16,0:06:20.13,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Yeah, I totally get how you feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.13,0:06:21.40,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,But don't even bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.40,0:06:24.07,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Reaper's pretty damned \Ngood at getting her way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.07,0:06:26.35,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Now that we're here, \Nenjoying yourself is the only option.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.30,0:06:30.20,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,And you {\i1}do{\i0} seem to be enjoying \Nyourself, Beast-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:32.04,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,A-Am not!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:33.99,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Have some, Judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.63,0:06:36.29,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Is this your first time eating takoyaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.29,0:06:37.43,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,It's very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.23,0:06:51.05,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Yes, it's quite delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.59,0:06:54.07,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,You're gonna give me a heart attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.07,0:06:57.60,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I feel hesitant \Nto express myself freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.60,0:07:00.19,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,That's no reason to retreat into a disguise!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.29,0:07:28.44,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Now, one big sleepover staple \Nis talking about romance!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.44,0:07:31.09,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Do you ever talk about anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.09,0:07:34.99,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,But being in love can inspire you in work!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.99,0:07:36.06,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.62,0:07:41.06,sign_10948_106_Personal_Achieve,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(433,300)}Personal Achievements on the Rise
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.37,0:07:40.41,top,Kiki,0,0,0,,I guess that is pretty convincing,\N coming from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.06,0:07:42.54,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,What is "being in love"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.53,0:07:45.94,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,Is being in love beneficial?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.94,0:07:48.78,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing but!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.78,0:07:51.15,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,Can you describe the effects \Nof "being in love"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.15,0:07:56.23,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,It makes every day feel joyous, \Nlike everything around you is shining!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.23,0:07:59.29,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,This suggests that you are \Ncurrently in a state of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.27,0:08:03.59,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,W-Well... we're not talking \Nabout me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.59,0:08:05.38,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,We are. You can't escape it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.60,0:08:08.18,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,Who is it? Is it anybody I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.18,0:08:09.63,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I-I'm not telling!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.63,0:08:11.70,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,Very well. I'll commence guessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.70,0:08:12.65,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,This one?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.65,0:08:13.65,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,This one?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.65,0:08:14.62,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,This one?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.34,0:08:18.31,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,There's no way it's Red, Judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.79,0:08:21.06,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.62,0:08:27.06,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,You're blushing, Reaper-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.06,0:08:29.92,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I-I think I turned the heater up too high.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.92,0:08:31.64,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Boy, it's hot in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.66,0:08:35.07,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,O-Oh, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.19,0:08:37.95,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I've got presents!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.81,0:08:40.55,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.47,0:08:45.46,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,To celebrate our new friendship!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.12,0:08:50.59,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,Then, we are friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.83,0:08:52.71,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Yeah, totally!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.17,0:08:58.72,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,And I made one for each of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.72,0:09:02.10,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Why in the world would you \Nmake this stuff, Reaper?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:04.73,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,But of course, she is \Nin the handicrafts club!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.43,0:09:33.51,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Are you leaving, Judgment?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.25,0:09:36.97,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.27,0:09:41.39,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,Thank you for inviting me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.22,0:09:44.98,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,I never intended to get closer with you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.98,0:09:46.98,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,I intended to leave immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.50,0:09:52.10,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,But I do believe that I enjoyed myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.95,0:09:53.70,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.36,0:09:59.06,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Come see us again sometime, Judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.46,0:10:05.37,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,You bet I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.47,0:10:14.19,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Sh-She gave me a heart attack...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.54,0:10:27.89,main,Ranran,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.27,0:10:37.44,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Hey, Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.05,0:10:39.99,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Are you really Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:42.37,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Desumi-sa—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.37,0:10:45.33,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Hey! You're breaking my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.34,0:10:45.83,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.97,0:10:46.83,sign_15488_152_Rip,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(120,20)}Rip
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.61,0:10:50.07,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing, Desumi-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.00,0:10:53.42,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I... I'm sorry, Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.74,0:10:58.03,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Love After World Domination.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.46,0:11:12.45,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,You fell for my trap, heroes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.45,0:11:15.40,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Here on this snowy mountain, \Nyou can't even move!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.40,0:11:17.53,main,Blue,0,0,0,,Isn't the same true for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.53,0:11:18.52,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.52,0:11:19.58,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.58,0:11:22.33,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Anyway, go, Gekko soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.36,0:11:27.77,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,I said, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.08,0:11:35.96,sign_16570_163_Mt__Takao_Summit,Sign,0,0,0,,Mt. Takao Summit
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.50,0:11:41.09,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Your coffee really is \Ntruly exceptional, Desumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.89,0:11:43.18,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You old kidder!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.52,0:11:44.92,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,The truth is, Desumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.92,0:11:46.93,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I have big news today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.83,0:11:51.74,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,At last, the book I worked so \Nhard on has been published!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.19,0:11:55.06,sign_17076_170_Which_Insects_Wo,Sign,0,0,0,,Which Insects {\c&H282052&\3c&H1C09C6&}Would Be Strongest {\c&H391DE5&\3c&HE2F7F7&}if They Were {\c&HC41C84&\3c&H6B183F&\fs40}Giant?\N{\fs20\c&HF0F5F2&\3c&H444845&}A Treatise\N{\b0}By Fudo Aikawa
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.52,0:11:53.45,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.06,0:11:56.59,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,That's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.59,0:11:57.57,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Well done, Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.57,0:11:59.91,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,To celebrate it going on sale,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.91,0:12:02.44,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I'm going to have a signing \Nat the bookstore tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.44,0:12:03.57,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,A signing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.57,0:12:06.85,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Would you stop by if you \Nhave time, Desumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.85,0:12:08.18,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Of course I'll be there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.18,0:12:10.05,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Even if it kills me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.62,0:12:15.08,sign_9447_74_1_Week_Earlier,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(530,138)\fad(861,1)\c&HFFFFFE&}The\NNext\N Day
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.08,0:12:18.84,sign_17076_170_Which_Insects_Wo,sign,0,0,0,,Which Insects {\c&H282052&\3c&H1C09C6&}Would Be Strongest {\c&H391DE5&\3c&HE2F7F7&}if They Were {\c&HC41C84&\3c&H6B183F&\fs40}Giant?\N{\fs20\c&HF0F5F2&\3c&H444845&}A Treatise\N{\b0}By Fudo Aikawa
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.50,0:12:18.84,main,friend A,0,0,0,,Desumi. Desumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.15,0:12:21.25,main,friend A,0,0,0,,C'mon, Desumi! Don't ignore me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.57,0:12:24.01,main,Friend B,0,0,0,,You want to go to a movie after school?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.01,0:12:27.64,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'll pass for today. I've \Ngot a signing to go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.64,0:12:28.89,main,Friend B,0,0,0,,A signing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.89,0:12:30.34,main,Friend A,0,0,0,,For this book?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.69,0:12:32.50,main,Friend B,0,0,0,,That book looks weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.50,0:12:35.30,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Regardless, it's important to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.30,0:12:37.12,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,We'll go out another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.12,0:12:39.35,main,Friend B,0,0,0,,You're bright red, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.35,0:12:41.72,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Well, I wouldn't say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.72,0:12:43.56,main,friend A,0,0,0,,No, you're seriously red.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.56,0:12:45.13,main,friend A,0,0,0,,Are you sure you don't have a fever?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.13,0:12:47.16,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,A-Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.80,0:12:47.16,sign_18361_195_Hot,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(100,205)}Hot
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.03,0:12:47.16,sign_18361_195_Hot,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(65,120)\fs26}Hot
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.28,0:12:47.16,sign_18361_195_Hot,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs26\pos(450,110)}Hot
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.49,0:12:47.16,sign_18361_195_Hot,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs26\pos(595,195)}Hot
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.16,0:12:51.12,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I am feeling a little... dizzy...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.83,0:12:58.42,main,friend B,0,0,0,,Hey... Desumi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.98,0:13:02.93,main,Friend A,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.93,0:13:06.64,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Got to get... to the signing...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.64,0:13:08.09,main,friend A,0,0,0,,In your condition?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.09,0:13:09.72,main,Friend B,0,0,0,,It could kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.02,0:13:11.76,main,Friend A,0,0,0,,Come on, get real.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.76,0:13:13.34,main,Friend B,0,0,0,,Let's get you to the nurse's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.34,0:13:16.60,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I did spend the whole \Nday on a snowy mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.87,0:13:19.93,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,but I was in a snow hut, at least...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.93,0:13:21.63,main,friend B,0,0,0,,That's what you do for fun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.36,0:13:25.86,sign_20053_239_Nurse_s_Office_A,sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(220,125)\fsp6\3c&HEFEAE4&}N{*\3c&HEFEBE5&}u{*\3c&HEFECE6&}r{*\3c&HEFEDE7&}s{*\3c&HF0EDE8&}e{*\3c&HF0EEE9&}'{*\3c&HF0EFEA&}s {*\3c&HF0F1ED&}O{*\3c&HF0F2EE&}f{*\3c&HF1F2EF&}f{*\3c&HF1F3F0&}i{*\3c&HF1F4F1&}c{\3c&HF1F5F2&}e
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.76,0:13:33.25,main,Kira,0,0,0,,I sense... illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.52,0:13:37.42,main,Friend A,0,0,0,,Sanzugawa-sensei, she's got a fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.44,0:13:40.17,main,Kira,0,0,0,,Oh, poor thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.63,0:13:43.99,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Blood Princess...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.60,0:13:45.94,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.94,0:13:48.35,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,As revealed in the previous \Nepisode's signs,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.35,0:13:53.66,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Nurse Sanzugawa is actually \NDesumi's colleague, Blood Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.28,0:13:56.98,main,Kira,0,0,0,,Just leave her to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.98,0:14:00.98,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,No... I have to get to the signing...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.24,0:14:04.61,main,Friend A,0,0,0,,Thanks for taking her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.65,0:14:07.19,main,Kira,0,0,0,,Take care, dears!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.98,0:14:11.37,main,Friend A,0,0,0,,Did Sanzugawa-sensei seem weirdly \Nhappy about this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.37,0:14:13.12,main,Friend B,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.37,0:14:13.12,sign_20053_239_Nurse_s_Office_A,sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(220,125)\fsp6\3c&HEFEAE4&}N{*\3c&HEFEBE5&}u{*\3c&HEFECE6&}r{*\3c&HEFEDE7&}s{*\3c&HF0EDE8&}e{*\3c&HF0EEE9&}'{*\3c&HF0EFEA&}s {*\3c&HF0F1ED&}O{*\3c&HF0F2EE&}f{*\3c&HF1F2EF&}f{*\3c&HF1F3F0&}i{*\3c&HF1F4F1&}c{\3c&HF1F5F2&}e
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.07,0:14:27.75,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.18,0:14:35.18,sign_17076_170_Which_Insects_Wo,sign,0,0,0,,{\fs8}Which Insects {\c&H282052&\3c&H1C09C6&}Would Be Strongest {\c&H391DE5&\3c&HE2F7F7&}if They Were {\c&HC41C84&\3c&H6B183F&\fs28}Giant?\N{\fs8\c&HF0F5F2&\3c&H444845&}A Treatise\N{\c&HAC4233&\3c&HC3BAB4&\fs13\fnArial}Now Available\N{\fs18}Fudo Aikawa Book Signing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.69,0:14:57.95,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,A chain?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.95,0:15:00.01,main,Kira,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.37,0:15:01.46,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.41,0:15:04.96,main,Kira,0,0,0,,Don't worry. You're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.96,0:15:08.09,main,Kira,0,0,0,,Now, let's get you changed,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.09,0:15:10.09,main,Kira,0,0,0,,Reaper-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.09,0:15:13.05,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Have to get to... book signing...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.62,0:15:17.18,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.18,0:15:19.65,main,Kira,0,0,0,,Come, now, let's wipe off that sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.45,0:15:21.77,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.02,0:15:25.48,main,Kira,0,0,0,,Someone as strong as you is rarely injured,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.48,0:15:28.65,main,Kira,0,0,0,,so this is the first time I've \Nbeen able to attend to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.65,0:15:32.86,main,Kira,0,0,0,,Now, dearie, let Mommy look after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.30,0:15:35.66,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Please go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.29,0:15:37.82,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Hey, Desumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.82,0:15:40.11,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,About our part-time job today…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.86,0:15:43.51,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Huh? She's not here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.51,0:15:46.02,main,Friend B,0,0,0,,Desumi caught a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.02,0:15:48.70,main,Friend B,0,0,0,,She's probably still sleeping \Nin the nurse's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.70,0:15:49.53,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.53,0:15:51.55,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,Desumi-san caught a cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.55,0:15:52.82,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,How unusual...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.82,0:15:54.06,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.06,0:15:55.18,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.18,0:15:59.68,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,I left myself in Blood's care once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.26,0:16:01.88,flashback,Kiki,0,0,0,,Sorry, Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.88,0:16:03.57,flashback,Kiki,0,0,0,,Can I ask for some treatment?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.57,0:16:05.52,flashback,Blood,0,0,0,,Oh, most certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.57,0:16:14.36,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,She treats anyone she \Nlooks after like a baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.15,0:16:19.62,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Her motherly instincts are out of control!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.89,0:16:21.87,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,I managed to escape with my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.87,0:16:24.59,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,but Mommy almost brainwashed \Nme in the process!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.59,0:16:26.73,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,Perhaps she succeeded?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.73,0:16:28.38,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,You just called her "Mommy."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:31.70,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Even if she is my rival, Reaper is my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.70,0:16:34.90,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,I have to save her from that hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.90,0:16:36.63,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,Do you think you can beat her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.63,0:16:39.74,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Yeah, when she sees someone \Nwho's sick, she loses all judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.74,0:16:42.64,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,We'll pretend to be sick to get close to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.85,0:16:45.27,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,and when she lets her guard down,\N we'll give her a pounding!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.62,0:16:47.98,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,I haven't forgotten what you put me through.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.98,0:16:51.12,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Listen up, Mommy! I'm about\N to traumatize {\i1}you{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.12,0:16:53.98,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Stay safe until we get there, Reaper!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.74,0:17:00.12,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Blood... what is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.12,0:17:01.18,main,Kira,0,0,0,,Now, now, dearie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.18,0:17:04.13,main,Kira,0,0,0,,It's "Mommy," not "Blood."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.83,0:17:08.29,main,Kira,0,0,0,,Here you are, sweetie, some nice porridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.55,0:17:12.73,main,Kira,0,0,0,,Oh, look at you! You're chewing so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.73,0:17:14.83,main,Kira,0,0,0,,Is it tasty?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.59,0:17:18.65,main,Kira,0,0,0,,My sweetie little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.30,0:17:22.26,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Not good...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.26,0:17:24.43,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,The signing's about to start...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.55,0:17:30.14,main,Blood,0,0,0,,Oh, darling dear. Are we sleepy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.69,0:17:35.20,main,Blood,0,0,0,,There, there. Mommy's here for nappy-time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.20,0:17:41.20,main,Blood,0,0,0,,Now, she'll read for you from \Nher original picture book...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.20,0:17:37.32,sign_25345_282_Fight__Bosslar_k,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fsp6\frz-17\fax-0.29\pos(20,100)}\hFi{\c&H40A43F&}g{\c&HB95054&}h{\c&H5669C1&}t{\c&H4F26BB&}!\N{\fsp0\c&H3516A3&}Bosslar-kun
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.32,0:17:37.45,sign_25345_282_Fight__Bosslar_k,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fsp6\frz-16.7\fax-0.3\pos(55,63)}\hFi{\c&H40A43F&}g{\c&HB95054&}h{\c&H5669C1&}t{\c&H4F26BB&}!\N{\fsp0\c&H3516A3&}Bosslar-kun
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.45,0:17:37.57,sign_25345_282_Fight__Bosslar_k,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fsp6\frz-37.64\pos(135,65)}Fi{\c&H40A43F&}g{\c&HB95054&}h{\c&H5669C1&}t{\c&H4F26BB&}!\N{\fsp0\c&H3516A3&}Bosslar-kun
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.57,0:17:41.20,sign_25345_282_Fight__Bosslar_k,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fsp6\frz-44.16\pos(215,75)}Fi{\c&H40A43F&}g{\c&HB95054&}h{\c&H5669C1&}t{\c&H4F26BB&}!\N{\fsp0\c&H3516A3&}Bosslar-kun
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.32,0:17:46.82,main,Blood,0,0,0,,"Long, long ago, in a far-away land,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.82,0:17:50.18,main,Blood,0,0,0,,there was a strong, brave,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.18,0:17:55.47,main,Blood,0,0,0,,and occasionally very silly \Nlittle boy named Bosslar-kun..."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.40,0:18:02.70,sign_25760_290_Momotaro,sign,0,0,0,,Momotaro
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.47,0:17:58.62,flashback,Deusmi's Mother,0,0,0,,"The old man went to the \Nmountains to gather wood,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.62,0:18:01.93,flashback,Deusmi's Mother,0,0,0,,while the old woman went to \Nthe river to do the washing..."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.91,0:18:07.23,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Mommy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.08,0:18:09.94,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Desumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.94,0:18:10.73,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.37,0:18:15.36,main,Kira,0,0,0,,Keep your voices down, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.36,0:18:18.84,main,Kira,0,0,0,,The baby just got to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.59,0:18:21.45,italics,Kiki,0,0,0,,Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.45,0:18:23.41,italics,Kiki,0,0,0,,She's gotten pretty far along...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.41,0:18:26.91,main,Kira,0,0,0,,Are the two of you under the weather as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.60,0:18:31.50,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, my stomach hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.21,0:18:34.01,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,And I have a bit of a cough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.01,0:18:35.38,main,Kira,0,0,0,,How awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.38,0:18:37.41,main,Kira,0,0,0,,Let me look after you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.45,0:18:39.51,italics,Kiki,0,0,0,,She fell for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.51,0:18:40.89,main,Kira,0,0,0,,Click!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.31,0:18:52.60,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Ow, ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.95,0:18:54.10,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.57,0:19:03.58,sign_27203_310_Special_Nurse_s_,sign,0,0,0,,Sp{\c&HF1BE4C&}ec{\c&H69FF64&}ial {\c&HE76AD7&}Nu{\c&HAE5ED8&}rs{\c&HF375B1&}e's {\c&HE17078&}Of{\c&H7BD257&}fi{\c&H448BDA&}ce
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.51,0:19:01.51,main,Both,0,0,0,,"Special nurse's office"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.26,0:19:15.63,main,Kira,0,0,0,,We don't have enough beds \Nup there, so I'll treat you here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.56,0:19:33.44,sign_20053_239_Nurse_s_Office_A,sign,0,0,0,,{\an3\fs8\fax0.13\frz343.9\pos(120,118)\c&H362914&\3c&H43351A&}N{*\3c&H47391E&}u{*\3c&H4A3D23&}r{*\3c&H4E4027&}s{*\3c&H52442C&}e{*\3c&H554830&}'{*\3c&H594C34&}s {*\3c&H61533D&}O{*\3c&H645741&}f{*\3c&H685B46&}f{*\3c&H6C5E4A&}i{*\3c&H6F624F&}c{\3c&H736653&}e
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.33,0:19:47.19,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Th-This is... Desumi-san's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.71,0:19:51.58,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Desumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.58,0:19:54.99,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,You weren't answering your \Nphone, so I went looking...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.88,0:20:01.09,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Wh-Why is she sleeping like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.09,0:20:02.38,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.35,0:20:10.56,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Read it again...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.56,0:20:13.52,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,R-Read... it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.76,0:20:15.86,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Yeah... Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.49,0:20:21.40,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Then I shall.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.24,0:20:25.24,sign_20053_239_Nurse_s_Office_A,sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(222,122)\fsp6\c&H1A0A05&\3c&H6D6652&}N{*\3c&H69624E&}u{*\3c&H655D49&}r{*\3c&H615945&}s{*\3c&H5E5441&}e{*\3c&H5A503C&}'{*\3c&H564C38&}s {*\3c&H4E4330&}O{*\3c&H4A3F2B&}f{*\3c&H473A27&}f{*\3c&H433623&}i{*\3c&H3F311E&}c{\3c&H3B2D1A&}e
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.53,0:20:26.22,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,"And in this writer's humble opinion, \Nthe strongest insect is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.22,0:20:28.14,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Of course, the ant!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.47,0:20:33.96,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Because the ant can lift several \Ntimes its own weight with its jaws—"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.10,0:20:36.07,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.07,0:20:38.21,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,You're up, Desumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.21,0:20:39.96,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Why are you—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.96,0:20:44.13,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I-It's not like that, Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.13,0:20:46.43,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I was... delirious with a fever...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.43,0:20:48.72,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,What? You have a fever, Desumi-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.72,0:20:50.23,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,That's awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.06,0:20:55.97,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Don't do that out of the blue! \NYou're making the fever worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.97,0:20:58.27,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,S-Sorry, I wasn't thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.49,0:21:00.36,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What about the signing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.36,0:21:02.53,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You didn't slip out, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.53,0:21:04.49,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Well, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.59,0:21:08.57,sign_17076_170_Which_Insects_Wo,sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\c&HA76258&\3c&HE8E5E2&\fad(256,387)}Fudo Aikawa Book Signing
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.66,0:21:12.12,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,We didn't get a single customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.66,0:21:14.63,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.56,0:21:21.67,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Does that mean I get the first autograph?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.42,0:21:26.33,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.23,0:21:34.02,main,Kira,0,0,0,,"And so, they lived happily \Never after together."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.65,0:21:37.28,main,Kira,0,0,0,,Isn't that lovely?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.28,0:21:38.26,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,Goo-goo...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.26,0:21:39.94,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Mommy...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.51,0:21:44.45,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Did you hear someone reading aloud just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.45,0:21:45.57,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.57,0:21:47.13,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,It's probably in your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.57,0:21:50.03,sign_31303_348_Fudo_Aikawa,sign,0,0,0,,Fudo Aikawa
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.69,0:23:22.63,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.63,0:23:23.75,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.75,0:23:24.79,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.79,0:23:25.88,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.88,0:23:26.99,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.99,0:23:28.01,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.01,0:23:29.76,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.76,0:23:31.63,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.09,0:23:40.25,sign_8302_60_Episode_1__I_Lov,sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(40,300)\fad(1005,1)\fsp1.3}Episode 12  {\fsp6}Eternal Rivals
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.73,0:23:37.54,top,Fudo's Mom,0,0,0,,Next time, the final episode: "Eternal Rivals"!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.54,0:23:39.09,top,Fudo & Desumi,0,0,0,,See you then!
